      "line": 24,
      "start": 1810
    },
    "text": "The operator wants agents to improve with their guidance: to say \"remember this\" or \"learn this\" to a particular role, to be asked why when the reason is not plain, to have the agent say what it is unsure of, and to have the system suggest lessons from what happens. All of this changes what a role carries into its next task, with provenance, chosen or confirmed by the operator. It does not change a model's weights."
  }
